      <description>Hi there! 🖖&#xA;I am a Research Scientist in Machine Learning and Cognition in the Paradigms of Intelligence team @ Google, where we work on frontier questions concerning the future of artificial, human, and hybrid intelligence.&#xA;Previously, I was an Assistant Professor in Cognition and Computation @ Aarhus University, a postdoc at the Psychoinformatics Lab @ UT Austin, a Data Fellow @ the United Nations&amp;rsquo; Centre for Humanitarian Data. I hold a MSc in Cognitive Science from the Centre for Mind/Brain Sciences at the University of Trento, and a PhD in Cognitive Science from Aarhus University.</description>
